    {
      "id": "c9xIKKxou2rjt9Hqx5HEj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490.4623579545455,
      "y": 174.99662642045456,
      "width": 290.6598205566406,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ay",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 108196535,
      "version": 365,
      "versionNonce": 1177934103,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1750196102673,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Urls -> Map<Url, List<Image>>\n\nA, B, C\nA -> A1, A2, A3\nB -> B\n\nA -> I0, I1, I2, I3, I4\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Urls -> Map<Url, List<Image>>\n\nA, B, C\nA -> A1, A2, A3\nB -> B\n\nA -> I0, I1, I2, I3, I4\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PNIapeMZ2qsWiElaCwYbU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 465.4857954545454,
      "y": 382.34818892045445,
      "width": 1324.01904296875,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "az",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2127539865,
      "version": 895,
      "versionNonce": 2016720695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "oBS1c3GZhKYkqjNxaybG3",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1750195643399,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We have to follow the links, and gather all images across them.\n- Pages can repeat under same parent url, the list of image should contain common image across all children pages\n\n- jpg, png, gif, etc.\n\n- API: post(list<url>) -> jobId\n- API: status(jobId) -> SUCCESS/PENDING/ERROR\n- API: get(jobId) -> Map [Paginated] [Both list under each url can be paginated, as well as the top level list of urls can be paginated]\n\n- up to 1000 urls: Input\n- Have a limit on depth (configurable): Say 5\n\nJob -> 100,000 image urls",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We have to follow the links, and gather all images across them.\n- Pages can repeat under same parent url, the list of image should contain common image across all children pages\n\n- jpg, png, gif, etc.\n\n- API: post(list<url>) -> jobId\n- API: status(jobId) -> SUCCESS/PENDING/ERROR\n- API: get(jobId) -> Map [Paginated] [Both list under each url can be paginated, as well as the top level list of urls can be paginated]\n\n- up to 1000 urls: Input\n- Have a limit on depth (configurable): Say 5\n\nJob -> 100,000 image urls",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
